OL,3,GNEWSAJury told prisoner admitted
OL,4,A#20,000 killing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prisoner serving a life sentence for
OL,7,Fmurder admitted carrying out a #20,000
OL,8,Fcontract killing, a jury has been told.
OL,10,FDavid Harrison, 77, is accused of
OL,11,Fmurdering taxi driver Harun Khan in
OL,12,FTipton in 2008. Prosecutors say he
OL,13,Flater confessed to the shooting.
OL,15,FNot guilty pleas to the murder of Khan
OL,16,Fand to wounding another man in a
OL,17,Fshooting on Dudley's Thornleigh Trading
OL,18,FEstate in 2007 were entered on
OL,19,FHarrison's behalf after he refused to
OL,20,Fattend court from custody.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
