OL,5,
OL,6,FJurors at Wolverhampton Crown Court
OL,7,Fheard a family dispute led to death
OL,8,Fthreats being made against Khan, 39, a
OL,9,Ffather of four who was shot outside his
OL,10,Fhome in Tudor Street, Tipton.
